<Layout title="About Broker Pal" description="Learn about Broker Pal and our investor-focused approach to investment financing.">
<div class="page"><div class="kicker">ABOUT BROKER PAL</div><h1>Financing conversations built around investors.</h1><p class="intro">Broker Pal, LLC is focused on helping real estate investors navigate financing for income-producing properties with clarity, responsiveness, and a practical understanding of the investment.</p><section><h2>We know every property is part of a bigger plan.</h2><p>For investors, financing is more than a rate or a loan amount. It's about the property, the rental strategy, the numbers, and what comes next. Our goal is to make the financing process easier to understand and easier to move through.</p><p>Whether you're purchasing a rental, refinancing an existing investment, or exploring cash-out options, we'll start by understanding what you're trying to accomplish.</p></section><section class="callout"><h2>A straightforward lending relationship.</h2><p>Clear communication. Thoughtful guidance. A focus on investment property financing.</p><a href="/contact">Talk with us →</a></section></div>
</Layout>
<style>:global(body){background:#002447;color:#f4f8fa}.page{max-width:850px;margin:auto;padding:55px 28px 70px}.kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#18d0d0;font-weight:800}.page h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,58px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2px;color:#f4f8fa;margin:20px 0}.page .intro{font-size:19px;color:#c5d6df;line-height:1.8}.page section{margin-top:48px}.page h2{font-size:27px;color:#10243c}.page section p{color:#c5d6df}.callout{background:#0b2e49;padding:30px;color:#fff;border:1px solid #18d0d0;border-radius:12px}.callout h2{color:#fff}.callout p{color:#c5d1dc!important}.callout a{color:#18d0d0;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}</style>